    "title": "UPS",
    "description": "Connect with The UPS Store with Ease\r\n\r\nSave time when shipping or dropping off packages at The UPS Store.\r\n\r\nAccess a personalized QR code that helps easily ship to contacts in your UPS address book, receive digital receipts, and track outbound packages.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s never been easier to ship and track your packages on-the-go. With the UPS app, you can get updates on your home screen, create shipping labels in a snap and track deliveries, wherever and whenever.\r\n\r\nThe app\u2019s modern, clean and responsive user experience offers game-changing functionality and gives you peace of mind with an unrivaled view into your package\u2019s status.\r\n\r\nInternational Shipping Made Easy\r\n\r\nLet us make international shipping easier for you with the UPS app. \r\nWe\u2019ve taken out unnecessary complications and offer clear guidance to help you ship quickly and avoid potential hold-ups.\r\n\r\nUPS is the only carrier that offers multiple types of proactive guidance so you can ship with confidence. Track your inbound and outbound international shipments on-the-go, bringing you and your customers peace of mind.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Connect with The UPS Store with Ease<br><br>Save time when shipping or dropping off packages at The UPS Store.<br><br>Access a personalized QR code that helps easily ship to contacts in your UPS address book, receive digital receipts, and track outbound packages.<br><br>It\u2019s never been easier to ship and track your packages on-the-go. With the UPS app, you can get updates on your home screen, create shipping labels in a snap and track deliveries, wherever and whenever.<br><br>The app\u2019s modern, clean and responsive user experience offers game-changing functionality and gives you peace of mind with an unrivaled view into your package\u2019s status.<br><br>International Shipping Made Easy<br><br>Let us make international shipping easier for you with the UPS app. <br>We\u2019ve taken out unnecessary complications and offer clear guidance to help you ship quickly and avoid potential hold-ups.<br><br>UPS is the only carrier that offers multiple types of proactive guidance so you can ship with confidence. Track your inbound and outbound international shipments on-the-go, bringing you and your customers peace of mind.",
